cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "FedSwarm: An Ant-Colony Metaheuristic for Federated Aggregation Weights"
abstract: >-
  Code, experiments, and paper materials for FedSwarm, which studies whether an
  ant-colony metaheuristic over the federated-learning aggregation weight vector
  improves on fixed and learned weighting for non-IID, multi-site brain-tumour MRI
  classification. See paper/00_ABSTRACT.md and HANDOVER.md in this repository for the
  full, current account of what was found.
